# bundled with explicit permission from Mike Aniki but kept local-only.
**/DefaultMusic/PS2 Menu - Ambience.mp3
**/DefaultMusic/ANIKI REMAKE - Hub OST.mp3
**/DefaultMusic/ANIKI REMAKE - Login OST.mp3

